00:51:11,250 --> 00:51:17,250
Language Lessons is a 2021 American screenlife drama film directed by Natalie Morales
(in her directorial debut) and written by Morales and Mark Duplass.

10
00:56:52,500 --> 00:56:58,500
The film stars Morales, Duplass and Desean Terry.

11
01:02:33,750 --> 01:02:39,750
The film follows the unexpected friendship that develops between Adam, a man whose
husband surprises him with online Spanish lessons, and his teacher, Cariño.

12
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
The film had its worldwide premiere at the 71st Berlin
International Film Festival on March 1, 2021.

13
01:13:56,250 --> 01:14:02,250
It was released on September 10, 2021, by Shout!

14
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:43,500
The film explores themes of language course,
platonic love, webcam, teacher, grief.

15
01:25:18,750 --> 01:25:24,750
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
